WEBVTT

00:04:58.716 --> 00:05:01.996
that the price of carbon
is going to go up,

00:05:01.996 --> 00:05:05.316
and the markets turbocharged
by alternatives --

00:05:05.356 --> 00:05:09.236
wind and solar, now cheaper
than fossil fuels --

00:05:09.276 --> 00:05:11.676
well, the markets are going
to constrain supply.

00:05:13.036 --> 00:05:16.236
The problem is it's not happening.

00:05:16.716 --> 00:05:19.596
Not fast enough to keep us safe.

00:05:20.756 --> 00:05:21.876
Why?

00:05:22.236 --> 00:05:24.556
Because the markets today are distorted,

00:05:24.596 --> 00:05:29.076
they're distorted by tax breaks
and fossil-fuel subsidies,

00:05:29.076 --> 00:05:33.716
but also because of the power
of the fossil fuel industry.